      <subsection name="Description" id="JavadocThrowsOrder_Description">
        <div>
          Checks that multiple <code>@throws</code> and <code>@exception</code> Javadoc tags are listed
          alphabetically by exception name.
        </div>
        <p>
          No violation is reported for a tag without an exception name, or for duplicate
          exception names that are already in order.
        </p>
      </subsection>

